  "description": "VOODOO SOUKRI\n\nSoukri is the little sister of the Braag. While both bikes share the same components and capabilities, Soukri comes in smaller packages to better adapt to shorter riders. This way more people can enjoy the ride quality of a modern 29” hardtail bike that suits their size without spending a fortune or having to rely on junior bikes.\n\nSoukri frame is available in smaller sizes than the Braag. Moreover, contact points like handlebar, cranks, saddle and seatpost have been adapted for smaller riders. Everything else is the same as the Braag, with the modern Microshift Advent 9-speed transmission, the hydraulic brakes and the big wheels as the highlights.\n\nThe Soukri is for riders looking for a reliable, affordable, yet exciting to ride MTB. No matter their size.\n\nBig wheels for short(er) riders.",
